''This article is about the cat unit. For its enemy variant, see [[Killer Cowbird Cat (Enemy)]].''

'''Killer Cowbird Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked from [[Horde of Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 852
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Killer Cowbird Cat
|name2 = True Killer Cowbird Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''True Killer Cowbird Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This is a <u>joke character</u>. Despite its [[Long Distance]] reach, its stats are absolutely terrible, being way too expensive for what it does, so even if you need a Cat with a lot of pierce, this is not the one to use.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

