==Trivia==
*Both Killer Cowbird Cat and [[Poultrio]], another character added in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]], are fusions. Killer Cowbird Cat is a combination of a [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]] who collided, while Poultrio is three comedians in one.

